for pb in playbooks:
    print(f"{pb['name']} — tasks: {len(pb.get('tasks', {}))}")
```

### Run an Automation Command
```python
resp = requests.post(
    f"{XSOAR_URL}/automation/execute",
    headers=headers,
    json={
        "script": "!ip ip=8.8.8.8",
        "investigationId": incident_id,
