- [ ] An implant calls back and appears in `sessions`/`beacons`
- [ ] Post-exploitation commands (`info`, `whoami`, `screenshot`) execute successfully
- [ ] An armory extension is installed and executed in-memory
- [ ] A SOCKS proxy or port-forward is established for pivoting
- [ ] Implants killed, listeners stopped, and artifacts removed at cleanup$S$, '{"browse_web","http_get","security_scan","shell_exec","create_deliverable"}', $S${"source":"mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills","pack":"cybersecurity","domain":"cybersecurity","subdomain":"red-teaming","tags":["Code","Testing","Analysis","Automation","Security","Compliance"],"files":2}$S$::jsonb, true)
