|-------|--------|--------|
| NX | Enabled/Disabled | No shellcode on stack |
| PIE | Enabled/Disabled | Randomized addresses |
| Canary | Found/Not found | Stack smash detection |
| RELRO | Full/Partial/None | GOT write protection |

