### Step 3: Craft Clickjacking Proof of Concept

Build an overlay attack that tricks users into clicking hidden elements.

```html
<!-- clickjacking-poc.html -->
<html>
<head>
<title>Win a Prize!</title>
<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
