| Port | Service | Concern |
|------|---------|---------|
| 22 | SSH | Lateral movement |
| 445 | SMB | Lateral movement, ransomware |
| 3389 | RDP | Lateral movement |
| 5985/5986 | WinRM | Lateral movement |
