## DMARC Policy Levels
| Policy | Enforcement | Score |
|--------|------------|-------|
| `none` | No enforcement (monitoring only) | 0 |
| `quarantine` | Suspicious mail sent to spam | +20 |
| `reject` | Unauthorized mail rejected | +40 |

